 "scope": "Auth configuration keys the pinned upstream Studio (public.ecr.aws/supabase/studio@sha256:948770ec467f, 2026.10.12-sha-3699278) carries in its own form definitions. These are the Supabase platform config keys; each maps to a GOTRUE_ variable by prefixing GOTRUE_ (to be confirmed per key by the live probe, plan phase A0).",
