  "claim": "The pinned Studio never requests /platform/auth/{ref}/config when IS_PLATFORM is false, so answering it from a proxy changes nothing.",
  "code": "useAuthConfigQuery enabled: enabled && IS_PLATFORM && ref !== undefined (client chunks 3vxfscsvszhgj.js and 3 others, identical)",
